rule shipping_fee v1
description "The shipping fee of an order, by its weight and its subtotal, in yen as a shop in Japan writes it (fictional)"

inputs
  weight   : mass[g]    range >=1g <=30_000g
  subtotal : money[円]  range >=0円 <=100_000円

outputs
  fee : money[円]  round down(1円)

table fee
| subtotal   | weight    | -> fee   |
| >=5_000円  | -         | 0円      |
| <5_000円   | <=2_000g  | 800円    |
| <5_000円   | >2_000g   | 1_200円  |

examples
| weight  | subtotal  | -> fee   |
| 2_000g  | 4_999円   | 800円    |
| 2_001g  | 4_999円   | 1_200円  |
| 2_001g  | 5_000円   | 0円      |
